#: scenario5:scenario5_C8B44013_7895_44FA_9FF0_BEBF7A098390
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa7093b3ddfdc6609cc0bac13af7691ab7bfa5dc3b775840a48f21e6999bd9c7
#. default-sha256: ca717a88d0ec7f5b32fe462763818d53ad209b3c610b64ca4ce9eec76b82d658
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C8B44013_7895_44FA_9FF0_BEBF7A098390"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Come over here, "
"Giselle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫―――こちらにおい"
"で、⟪k:15⟫ジゼル。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C5388316_4AF8_41FF_BB94_D906752DB5B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38c440af8ec3c44c4c795d3eec3903db65e42d15ea8da3d338b7b86aa69f0cb7
#. default-sha256: 2fb46ca653d50536f15f5de4903e86dd7ce9a43df73ce7efcfc0cc785c2b2fbc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C5388316_4AF8_41FF_BB94_D906752DB5B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫O... ⟪k:1⟫Okay... ⟪k:2⟫Um, ⟪k:3⟫may I ask why you asked me here so late at night, Master?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……は、⟪k:1⟫……あの、⟪k:2⟫……どういったご用事でしょうか、⟪k:3⟫旦那さま……。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫こんな夜更け"
"に……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F83B6FA4_0A4D_4D32_AEB8_FE729D14BBE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc20ab6f9c6bb49f4bc264355af471d5014ba8ff52fff7033759bfe26daf1676
#. default-sha256: dd22a04bcfad3aa0611c54165e3c8215d4ed52c7af1f8dac00b0facc45c38b2d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F83B6FA4_0A4D_4D32_AEB8_FE729D14BBE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, I just wanted to have a little chat.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Care for some wine? ⟪k:3⟫Come closer, and "
"I’ll pour you a glass."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫何、⟪k:1⟫少々お前と話がしてみたいだけだ。⟪k:2⟫ワインの一杯でも入れてやる。⟪k:3⟫近くへ来なさ"
"い。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_18808066_6C70_4776_9EFA_3988B0B129ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea0379abd2c4e29ac353f07badabe55f404fc2ed3b8c29f0eaf8059fd410636a
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_18808066_6C70_4776_9EFA_3988B0B129ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8AB286F4_8870_4659_A866_54B3342727A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9be9e56bc18317bb7459c6e22272b94631c79cf577d55a3117ac61f119969d14
#. default-sha256: 1c049a79eb231a81a88e8afb4017886774dcdc1034ef83cc36ab1c38d66daecb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8AB286F4_8870_4659_A866_54B3342727A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had this wine imported from up north.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They use very hard water, and like it "
"rather tart,⟪k:3⟫so it leaves quite the lasting impression on your tongue."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫このワインは北方から取り寄せたもので、⟪k:1⟫舌に痺れが残るほど酸味が強い。⟪k:2⟫水の硬さが良く"
"残っているのだ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6F031789_319B_41C4_A3D0_31783B92DEAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c708452e481f71f90d9bf95c35d181c19e02f118b077e0cd0a5dd525f0e405a
#. default-sha256: 6d9de2c4fb7838d7c26b5fec77a58a1826f1080c7d9b463e780fae7cd16bdfb5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6F031789_319B_41C4_A3D0_31783B92DEAF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And yet, it goes down so easily, you just can’t seem to stop.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What do you say? Have "
"a sip."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しかしびっくりするほど、⟪k:1⟫するすると飲めてしまうものでな。⟪k:2⟫どうだ、⟪k:3⟫味を見てみると"
"良い。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A7DB3716_4125_4953_BB80_3B1AF5ACE8B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 020b88cd41269b34b6ff6320668e989073ef0391670bf4efd78cae6a21dea9d4
#. default-sha256: 1699bedf801ead9809765c303dcd5932bd95bdfc8d2f9d5260bc90112241a9eb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A7DB3716_4125_4953_BB80_3B1AF5ACE8B9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or does your expertise as a trader allow you to evaluate a wine’s quality without tasting it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それとも、⟪k:1⟫商いの道にいたお前のことだから、⟪k:2⟫ワインの質は飲まずとも分かるものかな？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C73D6E2D_87A0_47AF_BE31_7FCC39A15642
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df79e5b1d4266b1cf60ed258622148421792bbf41759c52700bb9ad723a2fa23
#. default-sha256: 5d98792441170c8a7a593cdd2a46f73a51285afe9027e4427cbf89c0abea5fc1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C73D6E2D_87A0_47AF_BE31_7FCC39A15642"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫No... ⟪k:2⟫but... ⟪k:3⟫um..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫い、⟪k:1⟫いえ……、⟪k:2⟫その……、⟪k:3⟫でも……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_988676CC_0FEF_4F82_A1C3_81EED898432F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 907d20269fd2ce290ba862396f24f5979e760a2821c656612af248d674724b73
#. default-sha256: 8b4fa442b5ea26186145edfbdb0c2e3e58e058e71d4575fd520842ca4de68093
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_988676CC_0FEF_4F82_A1C3_81EED898432F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please, Giselle, don’t trample all over my good graces."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫頼むよジゼル、⟪k:1⟫私の好意を無碍にしないでおくれ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8FF9D03C_FD00_4C86_9660_B0BB6807D97A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c2bc31597f30a3159a4ba4ed6beb5dca1575a7417508c31605ce4d1b57f682d
#. default-sha256: d41eac6d9777f12883ae4e3fdf71b6a51809b5244ac7708c2eb27682d836d08e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8FF9D03C_FD00_4C86_9660_B0BB6807D97A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Very well then... ⟪k:1⟫I will have a sip, Master, but no more..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫では……、⟪k:1⟫一口だけいただきます。⟪k:2⟫旦那さま……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_FD377B5C_4C16_4F8E_BA4C_429CA91945C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60c0610ff81ca7c1205216c24ba90424a56a35c9cbab5c0961338585ff049daf
#. default-sha256: 16b5f970fd9f5cef5c7a9ec4b20a35d8087049f11d0b11482a9c5f4c2f7ae23a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FD377B5C_4C16_4F8E_BA4C_429CA91945C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Have you ever considered growing out your hair?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫お前は、⟪k:3⟫髪を伸ばそうとは思わないのか？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E29F143B_F382_48F0_B4F1_ABBC8CB3E7D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d058849f95f8d514b11608542ac5fbac99df678cebe685c1fb06452a47f45c28
#. default-sha256: 6d8f23162dd7ae682f032ac182a253f0ad25de8697dac84df3c361c963b69669
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E29F143B_F382_48F0_B4F1_ABBC8CB3E7D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Having long hair made it difficult to do my job..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その、⟪k:1⟫仕事の邪魔になっていたものですから……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C7A48ED1_2448_4AA8_BF6E_80046D9F0894
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 351ea737ce5d1ae87a13a6adf33dd3613490a978ec955d5ee8c8f7f57abdc612
#. default-sha256: c78260f8c4656d67a85550c60858b18440ccf90e08cf765e375195048569b4c5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C7A48ED1_2448_4AA8_BF6E_80046D9F0894"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’re not a merchant anymore, though.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You deserve to look like the woman you truly "
"are."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫今はもう、⟪k:1⟫商売人ではないのだ。⟪k:2⟫女らしく髪を伸ばすが良かろう。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_51F857EE_CF8D_433B_AEBB_2377099F1CDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a3b993431d34b16105b1a6a8633f2416d08ec84dbe6bab43eda5e8e26697328
#. default-sha256: 727c33e2789dba2e9d25c29224df39bbfc96521dd9c08f044581f4e679ef68c8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_51F857EE_CF8D_433B_AEBB_2377099F1CDA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I have no doubt longer hair would accentuate your natural beauty.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s a gorgeous "
"shade of black, so deep a man could get lost in it for years."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫長い髪はお前の美しさを引き立てるだろう。⟪k:1⟫良い色合いの黒髪だ。⟪k:2⟫すべてを飲み込んでしま"
"うほどの、⟪k:3⟫深みがある。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A3506C29_38F8_464A_82EC_9F7720D62ABB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea0379abd2c4e29ac353f07badabe55f404fc2ed3b8c29f0eaf8059fd410636a
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A3506C29_38F8_464A_82EC_9F7720D62ABB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8234106F_9681_42D8_AB1E_2BE5080A332D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd87a823fed19745f3a1082e9a7ab17fc263a41343e6ce3697d365b7055b7eaa
#. default-sha256: 72672a2aa88e58411770ee75ce38a201716eae60a6d1542d14f927e3a6772e01
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8234106F_9681_42D8_AB1E_2BE5080A332D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It would contrast the color of your skin fabulously.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Highlight your eyes, your "
"cheekbones, your nape, your shoulders, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and your chest..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫きっと、⟪k:1⟫お前の肌に良く映えることだろう……。⟪k:2⟫その瞳も、⟪k:3⟫横顔も、⟪k:4⟫首筋も、⟪k:5⟫"
"肩も、⟪k:6⟫そして胸元も――、⟪k:7⟫一層際立つに違いない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D2FD3556_C1A3_4F2A_81E3_6CBC62DF2171
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f085000a30887e8c50e88e7f6bbf99c0015184be5aa2a429e53c7fab95e9b12a
#. default-sha256: f5e1cc594e1b891d3ef068aeda16b06dcec1ca07147b77d516ca999eb97d0657
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D2FD3556_C1A3_4F2A_81E3_6CBC62DF2171"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Um, I— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I should get going..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あの、⟪k:1⟫わ……わたし、⟪k:2⟫そろそろ……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DB5B0621_8AA1_4961_A98A_6A15D6B839D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e21dd204c2cfabcb40a63ef3659d07266598e769dd51d09b22de0116d6effe0
#. default-sha256: 72415001d0ce47bd7594387662a4ba17cc7cfbcaf44607bbadc202f7106b5875
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DB5B0621_8AA1_4961_A98A_6A15D6B839D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, but we’re not done talking yet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……まだ話は終わっていないではないか……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C3E82633_B0DB_460B_93C9_4993811BDD30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c32d4933be23af5d10e6fd791d396c5be877aef513be6e118424b2371332f6a2
#. default-sha256: 5801ec8d1afbf044d9ba3e070e0541efa13ae63a21a8ce972059e1ce0c7dc663
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C3E82633_B0DB_460B_93C9_4993811BDD30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I... ⟪k:1⟫I would not want a lack of sleep to interfere with my ability to work tomorrow. "
"⟪k:2⟫Thank you very much for the wine. It was delicio—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫いえ……、⟪k:1⟫明日の仕事に差し障りますから。⟪k:2⟫ワイン、⟪k:3⟫ありがとうございました。⟪k:4⟫と"
"てもおいしか――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0FD4CDAC_9BFD_4255_88F5_B730FD725252
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63b9b0c906b9afae831b166c5d2e42e5e47a205ad1bb6809bb8a43ab3a89377b
#. default-sha256: ca4f6b5900ef92fd370ce16919969ddbe96c83db8ace1f7fbed953dbb7a81025
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0FD4CDAC_9BFD_4255_88F5_B730FD725252"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫—?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫………ッ！？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E38D7149_9007_43BB_A07F_2B215C0405B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b7e50cc2749617ee6caabc24d30a8a00b28d7de6359090f547b002f517383e8
#. default-sha256: b20882374d4fb7c623ae28fc00a45db3edae1e54b0d1362f50c2703217918810
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E38D7149_9007_43BB_A07F_2B215C0405B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No need to be so cold-hearted, now.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From the moment I first laid eyes on you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そう邪険にしないでも良いだろう。⟪k:1⟫私はお前を初めて見た時から……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F32900D5_D993_4CBA_AEB0_00311E14B013
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3418c96623bca9309ed791efd7338312441c7053f6645be9803efe9c8b182458
#. default-sha256: 1e568b113e31542cb9fdac0309f642dc3aa7d693704550014fcb9c47139a4c78
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F32900D5_D993_4CBA_AEB0_00311E14B013"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫M— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Master!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Th-⟪k:5⟫That’s enough fooling around for one night!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だ――、⟪k:1⟫旦那さま！　⟪k:2⟫ご、⟪k:3⟫ご冗談はよしてください……ッ！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7CF3E08F_D21D_4EA6_9D48_C90792B0C8F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73531cb3012e5e36cbf3a20c9d437083e7049e5256f80a8f70b9887129ac8eae
#. default-sha256: 93532c912d090f3bcd9f6202167c1c92b9249f69b81adc427457694630b79213
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7CF3E08F_D21D_4EA6_9D48_C90792B0C8F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, now, don’t be afraid.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wouldn’t do anything to hurt you.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I simply "
"want to express my love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そう怖がるな。⟪k:1⟫なに、⟪k:2⟫悪いようにはせんとも。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫私が――お前のことを愛してやろ"
"う。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_695B18EB_7B80_41FC_9EB3_58930EDAF01C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 129388f710f8d6922ba10e280eb999e6960f8fe7dce1262407e65f095fc53e55
#. default-sha256: 87dbfee22861123eca69886dd5c456d929b262889297f24dead9f1dd9d061a87
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_695B18EB_7B80_41FC_9EB3_58930EDAF01C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫L— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Let go of me!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I-I only came here to work, nothing more!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫はッ……、⟪k:1⟫離してッ！　⟪k:2⟫わ、⟪k:3⟫わたし、⟪k:4⟫こんなつもりで来たんじゃないわ！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9A2A3510_0093_4303_878F_376E620EF135
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b05a1399742cec153b064d40bada512148f753e48ee8b977a9b6f01839d8698
#. default-sha256: 39b22ecf074b3bb501733374159079db90e7cf6985e71fe2a58da7e2149eecc1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9A2A3510_0093_4303_878F_376E620EF135"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The first time I saw you, I thought it would be a tragic waste to leave you to wither away "
"working at some little street-side shop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫初めてお前を見たのは、⟪k:1⟫表通りだったな。⟪k:2⟫あんな軒先で枯れさせていくのは、⟪k:3⟫心底もっ"
"たいないと思ったものだ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F3005EFA_444A_4354_A225_921F01A37502
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
