msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_43B1A0FA_A5F5_4560_A2D9_68B226FC7D80"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was in far too deep. ⟪k:1⟫There was no turning back the clock."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫もはや後戻りなど出来ないところまで、⟪k:1⟫進んでしまった。⟪k:2⟫時の針を戻すことなど、⟪k:3⟫出来"
"やしない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9715B063_124D_411D_A32D_39BDFE2EB060
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d2b8f5cb083885a2154d0d74b5991e38bb71491dd627a4b8e850a0b6c07c524
#. default-sha256: 528ef7711e18a130b7e5795ca0ab60f749a3ac51bb8bde0dabf8235c87bd05cb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9715B063_124D_411D_A32D_39BDFE2EB060"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I even considered taking my own life on more than one occasion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫いっそ、⟪k:1⟫この命を絶ってしまえたらと思うこともあった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7E283FE5_63BE_4AA5_AE0C_A33689D95472
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9674583e22b21ed626d9ffb8e05e6c59794aaaaab4d0b5948d83fe9137ff47c
#. default-sha256: 3c2a286d74a33909ae8d8c9a4a64ae4bcad08431a3e746398fb974f645fb4a9a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7E283FE5_63BE_4AA5_AE0C_A33689D95472"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But every time the thought crossed my mind, happy memories came with it. ⟪k:1⟫Back when it "
"was just the three of us girls and the shop.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Life may not have been easy, but it was "
"never dull either."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれど、⟪k:1⟫そういう時には決まって、⟪k:2⟫昔の楽しい思い出が蘇る。⟪k:3⟫苦しい生活でも、⟪k:4⟫"
"母と姉、⟪k:5⟫女三人で賑やかに生活していた日々が……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_12D5D2EE_6477_4AA3_9995_C3BD3F5831CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38157cdd1c066006010b2e6685b8ac115be251151228411ce82613cd99edc14f
#. default-sha256: 1428fa4df5e647bbf3052c42775b2454ab12baf7566f50796eea620cf217e6c4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_12D5D2EE_6477_4AA3_9995_C3BD3F5831CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I didn’t want to end my life at its absolute lowest point."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……こんな最悪の状況で、⟪k:1⟫最悪の気分で、⟪k:2⟫最悪の気持ちを抱えたまま、⟪k:3⟫死にたくなどな"
"い。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_FD06AF7E_2560_45F2_944E_1B58C87617FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9cfcf134d79ff4ba3eef7d9bb7e28ec5145726b3f6eb8c247bcb01543c99f9e0
#. default-sha256: 491889dcadd8a6e42b79df7fb86134bcb3847c57ac5bc83dc6bf4da8d625fc6d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FD06AF7E_2560_45F2_944E_1B58C87617FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted, if just temporarily,⟪k:1⟫to go back to the way things were back then..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もう一度――せめてもう一度。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫和やかで、⟪k:3⟫幸福な日々を取り戻したい……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5076E858_BDAB_43D6_A3FC_A3D71291F331
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6b9a22cbec54d7be52e900ec63496c9d260090f736dcec8cf61d13810368d83
#. default-sha256: af2896206e283881d36495f80c9859b32290a86f0fffc9e7c2d44df8c4d8aa7b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5076E858_BDAB_43D6_A3FC_A3D71291F331"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That objective was the only thing that allowed me to keep going."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その意志だけで、⟪k:1⟫わたしはボランジェ家での日々を耐え続けていた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C06E73D9_3101_4E8A_B88B_AF079759DA99
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 746f383c66c203ac7db298cf9f0953c92d7eb7d5eece5267966adfe06e4e0fb6
#. default-sha256: 0d756c9b47174c75c54466db4cd4af1fdcaa9c4687c39ab45600066ff0b7eaf6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C06E73D9_3101_4E8A_B88B_AF079759DA99"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I was in his presence, I tried to convince myself I was merely an object.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I "
"had no emotions, so he couldn’t hurt me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あの男の前では、⟪k:1⟫自分はモノなのだと思うようにした。⟪k:2⟫感情がなければ、⟪k:3⟫何も傷つくこ"
"とはない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2B02D1E2_4760_41EA_A31F_5E9954ACB823
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 966316eda39fcf19e771bb876cbbacf42f38c3d87ec823ff11e4529fb1458cda
#. default-sha256: d1f77f532d11490a178513ae647b504a85cc26f56825e76f90592b1599af3431
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2B02D1E2_4760_41EA_A31F_5E9954ACB823"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫His hands couldn’t reach my heart,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたしは器だけ。⟪k:1⟫ただの肉の塊。⟪k:2⟫あの男が触れているのは、⟪k:3⟫わたしの心ではない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F7E4BD27_0335_40CB_B922_23CF301116D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 370edc50b8aee68675cc66add52e5ba862ce41243e26cc890745046b98bca77e
#. default-sha256: 2bb588374eaab00cf324c16dbfa39b341f419904a926cd8755a21de411b9d910
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F7E4BD27_0335_40CB_B922_23CF301116D0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫for it was not connected to my body."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたしの心と肉体は、⟪k:1⟫繋がっていない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_CB63FF7A_0A1D_4306_85E6_F190B75C2889
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3aaf7e4ae1faaa4ddc937b589c2ac94a4b866299f8c96d0c68901188e9f90d95
#. default-sha256: 2ac093232431f705f375134deda5efd51c8487fa3eeed8a181aec48f62e1e1bc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CB63FF7A_0A1D_4306_85E6_F190B75C2889"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Doing that made it a little easier to bear,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そうしていると、⟪k:1⟫いくらか楽にもなったけれど……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_BD46EAB8_8A67_4B7B_99A7_D121E318BF44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 879f2d123f77b1bc5c2220d46fe60966837858c7964c02d8c575a7dd350dbad0
#. default-sha256: b390e7c38da55292340037a274c342121d52ed194ef6d757ed6b7e217cb8e703
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BD46EAB8_8A67_4B7B_99A7_D121E318BF44"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but the reality was, it was impossible to completely sever my heart from my body."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫結局のところ、⟪k:1⟫本当に、⟪k:2⟫心と肉体を遮断することなど、⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫出来やしないのだ……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A71F91C_EF9C_4C00_9A8B_C5595B2028FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 154663fde5febef5e1030165a8077425672e63335a5f26a0fefa42167d8185e5
#. default-sha256: e750ed7b06e7cf279cad56d6dda035531eace81ed400c349939a53b406e4f45e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A71F91C_EF9C_4C00_9A8B_C5595B2028FE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’re Giselle, aren’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫―――あなたがジゼルね。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DF037EBD_D86C_45CA_9C5F_83A724E96A00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a37167be35f0205c2aefbe02244637798cc03f42877ecb9b8218a18ab1938ea
#. default-sha256: fef1962416e2a79cc561d2e22eaf512e404b50eec15a1288f8d992da79679d9f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DF037EBD_D86C_45CA_9C5F_83A724E96A00"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫One day, the mistress of the estate stopped me in the halls."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ある日、⟪k:1⟫屋敷の廊下でわたしを呼び止めたのは、⟪k:2⟫ボランジェ家の奥方だった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7CAECF07_8336_4ED7_B3F0_227FF0ADDFB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 936fdfade27d4f1c0675546cb7518149bc33d6acef4a54c57ba8a296c5be5423
#. default-sha256: b70580893860d6ae72452e9e6d8dac3e8638ad23fa35195c68e8b9039d456e52
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7CAECF07_8336_4ED7_B3F0_227FF0ADDFB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had, supposedly, once been quite beautiful, but now she was only haggard and bony."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫昔は大層美しい人だったらしいのだけど、⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫憔悴しきった面持ちは、⟪k:3⟫その面影を残してい"
"ない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_EB611ACB_B35D_4124_8B3B_C13FE06A9AA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f730adc02e8942b3e287628c1ba3e706f02b7d8bea00488a6d1ece9499c4751f
#. default-sha256: fa1b933f762de5d9c4a1f33dddd9bc1eb716f62f435392d254e26f36a7d74703
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EB611ACB_B35D_4124_8B3B_C13FE06A9AA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her skin dry, her eyes sunken, her hair faded and stripped of its luster, her head down, her "
"cracked lips barely moving as she spoke."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫乾いた皮膚、⟪k:1⟫落ちくぼんだ眼窩、⟪k:2⟫艶のない褪せた金髪、⟪k:3⟫うつむいた姿勢、⟪k:4⟫ひび割"
"れた唇から発せられる陰鬱な声。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_126DFA18_91A2_4506_8DF7_0D01694C541B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45f6aa661394e337ba27ec9214772d4e023be6d56c29d96406af5bda28d8755d
#. default-sha256: 9193f26ac7e9289348af01fd19b99f3244b1ee9983b3d6973278a7e2e4424f05
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_126DFA18_91A2_4506_8DF7_0D01694C541B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Age didn’t appear to be the only thing working its merciless magic on her either. ⟪k:1⟫There "
"seemed to be something eating away at her from the inside too—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫something that could "
"burst at the lightest touch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫年老いたから――、⟪k:1⟫それだけが理由ではなく。⟪k:2⟫内側から滲むような、⟪k:3⟫あやうい何かがそう"
"させているように見えた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_203C88F6_A774_415E_ACC7_2EB551047818
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec1117175663845f8050df1d7a00edac3bd75cbd76d0de95d84185294dba1445
#. default-sha256: 98f047a4661904a45f6138d0b0e788feb430a7a61dccdcf81d0b06d7a74673d0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_203C88F6_A774_415E_ACC7_2EB551047818"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Y-⟪k:1⟫Yes, I am Giselle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Is there something I can do for you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫は、⟪k:1⟫はい……そうですが、⟪k:2⟫わたしに何か……？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_616B69F6_7C21_449D_98FE_D1F2A65961D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95e54855411b8a9b6d3d072d594dc937c8fea6fd8aed0b32c406dd6ba5e3157c
#. default-sha256: 906328e17910cc73a0e71fcab8591d1d0de527c7756ad6727973eab90f80b443
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_616B69F6_7C21_449D_98FE_D1F2A65961D0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mistress rarely ever left her chambers. ⟪k:1⟫I had been told it had been years since she "
"attended family supper."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫――奥方が部屋から出てくるのは、⟪k:1⟫滅多にないことだった。⟪k:2⟫一家揃う晩餐にも、⟪k:3⟫彼女はも"
"う何年も顔を出していないらしい。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A591642B_1E4F_4B0D_B02F_544E1C8F0642
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d4e8744da427f5af5b2bc12fa20f725d91e96a8a1b5892ed0933d79b1b72186
#. default-sha256: 5bc1b694ecb7b0972b540eb6a82a1ee1d66bb2aad5635a6945dcc4ef8b1b2dc5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A591642B_1E4F_4B0D_B02F_544E1C8F0642"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So what would bring her to come looking for someone like me?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そんな人が、⟪k:1⟫わたしの前に現れるなんて。"

